		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκρητ-</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stand of a</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρατήρ, κρητὴρ καὶ ὑποκρητήριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
